            </locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction>
        </geography>
        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">50 kWhel lean burn engine\n\n# Included processes\nUse of biogas in a cogeneration unit. In addition to biogas also diesel is used as a fuel (0.05 kg diesel per kg biogas). Included are emissions to air, biogas consumption, use and disposal of operational supplements. The calculated emissions include emissions due to the combustion of bio gas and diesel. Infrastructure expenditures are accounted for, too.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
    </processInformation>
